/E (The research identified several strengths within library services. Positive staff interactions, welcoming environments and a strong sense of belonging were consistently highlighted as critical enablers of engagement. Access to free or low-cost IT services, clear navigation within library spaces and the availability of community activities also play a vital role in supporting people on low incomes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
