/E (The following sections of this document share some of the findings of the work outlined above. As the work has been delivered in three areas of England, Children North East has been able to establish what barriers are specific to the places we have worked with and what may be felt more universally in libraries in England. The following two sections share what came out as working well in the majority of areas and what some of the common barriers were.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
