<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (The following findings are drawn directly from consultations with library staff, users and non-users across the three areas.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (The intention is for these to be used as a starting point for libraries to reflect upon their own policies, procedures and practices. It is important to keep in mind that these themes are not exhaustive, nor can it be assumed that all themes are present in each library service. A poverty aware approach should always be place-based and be led by those experiencing structural barriers. See Principles of a Poverty Informed Service below.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
